<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian companies ex-dividend today.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian companies ex-dividend today.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following companies are ex-dividend today, according to the Australian Stock Exchange:</p>
<p>Ex-dividends-</p>
<p>    Davids Ltd	  5.00 cents</p>
<p>    Devine Ltd	  2.00 cents</p>
